h the Australian standard, but the more meticulous German and British standards too. </div><div>\nWatch the full rimless flush in action in the video below!</div><div>\n<b>Notes &amp; Inclusions:</b></div><div>\n- 4 Star WELS Rating</div><div>\n- Connector, soft close seat, and fixings included.</div><div>\n- S-trap connector supplied as standard.</div><div>\n- Set out 60 - 120 mm (S -Trap)</div><div>\n- Suitable for S -Trap or P -Trap Installation</div><div>\n- Cleanmax nanotech anti-bacterial surface technology<br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
